  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EeQU5Eq.png\" width=\"650\"/>\n</p>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3073\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/cmee6m.jpg\" width=\"800\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n「氧化銅工具」加入了會隨耐久度消耗而逐漸氧化的工具，外觀會從閃亮的銅色轉變為帶有綠色銅綠！這是為遊戲前期裝備增添更多生動感與故事性的簡單方法。氧化程度能清楚顯示你還剩多少耐久度。\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/oct\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R2meelb.png\" width=\"400\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/oxidizing-copper-tool\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qp0TljH.png\" width=\"400\"/>\n  </a>\n</div>",
